; The REPL's float value printer (src/repl.nuc: repl-print-f64 / repl-print-f32).
; Since Stage 16 retired src/repl_shim.c this is Nucleus, not C: it calls the
; JIT'd nullary thunk through a `(fn f64)()` parameter and renders `%.17g` /
; `%.9g` with `.0` appended when the rendering carries no `.`, exponent, or
; nan/inf marker. c-header-layout.md §11.
1.0
2.5
(+ 1.0 2.5)
(/ 1.0 3.0)
(- 0.0 4.0)
(* 1.0 1e300)
(/ 1.0 0.0)
(/ 0.0 0.0)
(as f32 0.5)
(let (x:f32 2.0) x)
(let (x:f32 (/ 1.0 3.0)) x)
